#
# The screens `make quadra-m68040` accepts as the end of the boot, one a line:
#   <machine> <sha256 of the PNG, first 16 hex digits> <what it shows>
# MAME is deterministic: the same build, ROMs and options give the same
# screen. The PNGs themselves are never committed (Apple firmware output).
# With the zero-filled stand-in for the ADB modem's PIC firmware (no
# 342s0440-b.bin supplied), the ROM stops in ADB initialisation on the grey
# desktop pattern (doc/oracles.md, "MAME's Quadra").
macqd650 c8702c3418f7f4b4 grey desktop, ADB initialisation waiting (stand-in ADB firmware)
macct650 a85547398b82898f grey desktop, ADB initialisation waiting (stand-in ADB firmware)
